end="italic">‘Psalmen’ <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:siehe"><abbr>s.</abbr></ref></hi> <ref type="entry" target="entry:fiftig">fiftig</ref> <hi rend="bold">5</hi>) do; <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Optativ"><abbr>op</abbr></ref></hi> 3, <hi rend="italic">tue</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 11 <hi rend="bold">6</hi>) <hi rend="italic">verb. <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Substantiv"><abbr>subst</abbr></ref>.</hi> <hi rend="bold">a</hi>) <hi rend="italic">‘seien’, <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Plural"><abbr>pl</abbr></ref>, obwol <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Singular"><abbr>sg</abbr></ref></hi> beo <hi rend="italic">vorhergeht,</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Episc">Episc</ref> 12 <hi rend="bold">b</hi>) <hi rend="italic">ergänzbar <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:aus"><abbr>aus</abbr></ref> dessen vorhergehender Negirung:</hi> aðwyrðe næron, <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:accusativus"><abbr>ac</abbr></ref> ordales wyrðe [<hi rend="italic">erg:</hi> wæron] <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEw">I Ew</ref> 3 <hi rend="bold">c</hi>) <hi rend="italic">bei</hi> wa, wel <hi rend="italic">wehe, wohl <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sieheDort"><abbr>s. d.</abbr></ref></hi> <hi rend="bold">7</hi>) <hi rend="italic">das Verb der Bewegung</hi> <hi rend="bold">a</hi>) gan: ælc si griðes wyrðe, [<hi rend="italic">gehend</hi>] to gemote ⁊ fram gemote <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 82; nelle ic from minum hlaforde <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:El">El</ref> 11 <hi rend="bold">b</hi>) hwæðer he to bote (<ref type="lawCode" target="law:H">H</ref> <hi rend="italic">fügt ein:</hi> cirran) wille <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 26,1 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ld">Ld</ref> <hi rend="bold">8</hi>) <hi rend="italic">ein aus dem Zushg. allein ergänzbares Handeln:</hi> nalles þa gegildan [<hi rend="italic">gelan